                        ],
                        "form": "уве́ренности"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f3f6e58d-3b39-4815-a2c2-3d8484bf9aa4",
                        "entry_id": "261780d4-f8b1-31ac-9c1f-9e1cc348e862",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "уве́ренностях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "92e36289-b5c6-3f72-bce0-c402703c3a4c",
                        "entry_id": "261780d4-f8b1-31ac-9c1f-9e1cc348e862",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного уверенный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6e8d1c95-713e-4754-9984-5328f2e75a43",
                                "sense_id": "92e36289-b5c6-3f72-bce0-c402703c3a4c",
                                "text": "Спал накануне мало, а бодрость, бойкость и уверенность ума."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "daebba17-2af1-4749-a396-dd2042d6c9e1",
                                "sense_id": "92e36289-b5c6-3f72-bce0-c402703c3a4c",
                                "text": "И в том, как легко взлетал топор, чувствовалась уверенность и молодая сила."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "79e8807d-c08f-351e-8650-ee346c393d0b",
                        "entry_id": "261780d4-f8b1-31ac-9c1f-9e1cc348e862",
                        "glosses": [
                            "совершенная убеждённость, твёрдая вера в кого-либо, что-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "60f3591c-56c1-4f2f-b83b-989a7266a84c",
                                "sense_id": "79e8807d-c08f-351e-8650-ee346c393d0b",
                                "text": "А в общем было тупое унылое чувство и уверенность, что жизнь уже испорчена и что ничем её не исправишь…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8c12a51-4255-4aec-8b17-2e1b9a184cae",
                                "sense_id": "79e8807d-c08f-351e-8650-ee346c393d0b",
                                "text": "Сила желания и уверенность! Это — всё, это — знаменитый Архимедов рычаг."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79a64391-33ee-4516-9925-1cefc3502b5a",
                                "sense_id": "79e8807d-c08f-351e-8650-ee346c393d0b",
                                "text": "Мы имели твёрдую уверенность, что у нас «житница Европы», и вдруг в этом пришлось усомниться."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "83ea2a2c-7794-4703-adff-2927e3be8b72",
                        "source_entry_id": "261780d4-f8b1-31ac-9c1f-9e1cc348e862",
                        "target_lang_word": "assurance",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "assurance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40addcc9-d06b-3fc1-8051-c3101888e978",
                                        "entry_id": "00d71e1a-7c05-3df5-8568-d08e6c69e700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of assuring; a declaration intended to inspire full confidence; something designed to give confidence to someone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "966c0643-8cf4-4979-810d-6949eb78d9ba",
                                                "sense_id": "40addcc9-d06b-3fc1-8051-c3101888e978",
                                                "text": "Whereof he hath given assurance unto all men, in that he hath raised him from the dead."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61be6f3e-dcfb-477c-9f94-1c5cf0a4b160",
                                                "sense_id": "40addcc9-d06b-3fc1-8051-c3101888e978",
                                                "text": "Assurances of support came pouring in daily."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15bbd3b5-799a-4a71-bedb-fbd3879ee525",
                                                "sense_id": "40addcc9-d06b-3fc1-8051-c3101888e978",
                                                "text": "Madam, it has been represented to me that you are appalled by my exalted rank. I desire to convey to you officially my assurance, that if your hesitation is attributable to that circumstance, it is uncalled for."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48d2177c-59d6-3170-ac26-7fcbebca11fa",
                                        "entry_id": "00d71e1a-7c05-3df5-8568-d08e6c69e700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being assured; total confidence or trust; a lack of doubt; certainty; guarantee."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee7cf918-b864-416c-a5ef-605d552bb89f",
                                                "sense_id": "48d2177c-59d6-3170-ac26-7fcbebca11fa",
                                                "text": "Let us draw with a true heart in full assurance of faith, having our hearts sprinkled from an evil conscience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d40c5608-71d6-4c87-9db3-f7ef7eba1da7",
                                                "sense_id": "48d2177c-59d6-3170-ac26-7fcbebca11fa",
                                                "text": "The storm took countless lives and forced hundreds of thousands of people to flee from their communities with no assurance of returning soon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0589d0f9-0141-3196-a25d-76432c20b5f2",
                                        "entry_id": "00d71e1a-7c05-3df5-8568-d08e6c69e700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Firmness of mind; undoubting steadiness; intrepidity, courage, or self-confidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a496541b-ae8a-41d9-98f7-5f122be5db1e",
                                                "sense_id": "0589d0f9-0141-3196-a25d-76432c20b5f2",
                                                "text": "the affairs of the Tarkish camp together with assurance"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14cec4f4-093c-41c3-bc93-64e5c9c08962",
                                                "sense_id": "0589d0f9-0141-3196-a25d-76432c20b5f2",
                                                "text": "Conversation, when they come into the world, soon gives them a becoming assurance"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f31d5b6-918b-46eb-bd5e-35e2b2e797e3",
                                                "sense_id": "0589d0f9-0141-3196-a25d-76432c20b5f2",
                                                "text": "This new-comer was a man who in any company would have seemed striking.[…]His air, of self-confident assurance, seemed that of a man well used to having his own way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e490091-4019-48a6-ab8f-f7c6ff0aac6e",
                                                "sense_id": "0589d0f9-0141-3196-a25d-76432c20b5f2",
                                                "text": "\"Oh, that wouldn't make any difference,\" Benny replied with great assurance as he started to go out again."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33da99e4-e5b6-399c-8ef2-192b0d8aae2f",
                                        "entry_id": "00d71e1a-7c05-3df5-8568-d08e6c69e700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excessive boldness; impudence; audacity"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1a74e04-28f5-4293-9204-d577fc3b1c0a",
                                                "sense_id": "33da99e4-e5b6-399c-8ef2-192b0d8aae2f",
                                                "text": "His assurance is intolerable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce405d69-5c1a-4813-afc1-1de0e7680b9d",
                                                "sense_id": "33da99e4-e5b6-399c-8ef2-192b0d8aae2f",
                                                "text": "You confined to the society of the illiterate and vulgar all your life! I wonder how the young man could have the assurance to ask it. He must have a pretty good opinion of himself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea256024-1e46-3e4d-aab4-f3a70d46e5f3",
                                        "entry_id": "00d71e1a-7c05-3df5-8568-d08e6c69e700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Betrothal; affiance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "101f1e39-a7c5-3687-9a30-1903967d8901",
                                        "entry_id": "00d71e1a-7c05-3df5-8568-d08e6c69e700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Insurance; a contract for the payment of a sum on occasion of a certain event, as loss or death. Assurance is used in relation to life contingencies, and insurance in relation to other contingencies. It is called temporary assurance, in the time within which the contingent event must happen is limited."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76a50ad5-4a6b-31d3-9f94-0f6bcb8e2aaa",
                                        "entry_id": "00d71e1a-7c05-3df5-8568-d08e6c69e700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any written or other legal evidence of the conveyance of property; a conveyance; a deed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d54e6276-000c-4bf8-b7de-b757550028b7",
                                                "sense_id": "76a50ad5-4a6b-31d3-9f94-0f6bcb8e2aaa",
                                                "text": "the legal evidences of the conveyance of property are called the common assurances of the kingdom."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8479be1-7680-3bc9-86f6-61076e01bfd7",
                                        "entry_id": "00d71e1a-7c05-3df5-8568-d08e6c69e700",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Subjective certainty of one's salvation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b5be38d4-d110-4b16-8614-924a3fe5c1c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "261780d4-f8b1-31ac-9c1f-9e1cc348e862",
                        "target_lang_word": "certainty",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "certainty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82323740-b9f5-37ee-a5fd-e406cacb1fa2",
                                        "entry_id": "288c45bf-0bcf-3eb0-9f43-79ec62fbbb6a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being certain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6012bc03-bd3e-4c35-8552-2d71692055cf",
                                                "sense_id": "82323740-b9f5-37ee-a5fd-e406cacb1fa2",
                                                "text": "The certainty of punishment is the truest security against crimes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc45e397-2978-4ff2-9439-29d2bee2a66c",
                                                "sense_id": "82323740-b9f5-37ee-a5fd-e406cacb1fa2",
                                                "text": "That there may be Certainty upon an infallible Evidence in Matters of Science, I readily grant you. But since there once were Scepticks in Philosophy as well as Religion, such as doubted of every thing, I very much question, whether the whole World be agreed in this Point; unless you could assure me, that Race of Seekers is now extinct."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c297576-4969-3cf8-a148-cd5bd71c6fc5",
                                        "entry_id": "288c45bf-0bcf-3eb0-9f43-79ec62fbbb6a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of being certain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d4f14c3-62ec-3fb7-934a-bad0b9e3b61f",
                                        "entry_id": "288c45bf-0bcf-3eb0-9f43-79ec62fbbb6a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fact or truth unquestionably established."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "326d0653-157f-4427-94cb-d4a05f99916d",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4f14c3-62ec-3fb7-934a-bad0b9e3b61f",
                                                "text": "Certainties are uninteresting and sating."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "676718c9-6f13-46f3-8f1c-7404ca99e1cc",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4f14c3-62ec-3fb7-934a-bad0b9e3b61f",
                                                "text": "There is a certainty attainable. A certainty of feeling will arise through the very contemplation of Jesus. But there is also attainable a certainty of Reason."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adb4a9e9-7480-4ab7-8d97-15bf81af13aa",
                                                "sense_id": "6d4f14c3-62ec-3fb7-934a-bad0b9e3b61f",
                                                "text": "Yet the truth is that City would probably have been coasting by that point if the referee, Michael Oliver, had not turned down three separate penalties, at least two of which could be accurately described as certainties."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "db80a2d0-f26b-4122-ad5e-8948b3cbac33",
                        "source_entry_id": "261780d4-f8b1-31ac-9c1f-9e1cc348e862",
                        "target_lang_word": "confidence",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "confidence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d54a281-052b-3fee-b037-1a8f8fd8e5e8",
                                        "entry_id": "4a72190e-4978-3219-8349-225208226a49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Self-assurance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91447330-766d-4ee2-9b41-8225eff0253b",
                                                "sense_id": "2d54a281-052b-3fee-b037-1a8f8fd8e5e8",
                                                "text": "He entered the ring with confidence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d5d7ed5-8890-383b-8d3b-cb24a38a0962",
                                        "entry_id": "4a72190e-4978-3219-8349-225208226a49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feeling of certainty; firm trust or belief; faith."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c953efe6-64e8-4d49-99ac-8fd103c483f5",
                                                "sense_id": "7d5d7ed5-8890-383b-8d3b-cb24a38a0962",
                                                "text": "She had confidence it would soon end."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b87f62f3-206b-4ad0-be18-546ff46a3863",
                                                "sense_id": "7d5d7ed5-8890-383b-8d3b-cb24a38a0962",
                                                "text": "It is better to truſt in the Lord : then to put confidence in man. / It is better to truſt in the Lord : then to put confidence in Princes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe0ebaca-3e7d-455d-bd1d-3d022851f240",
                                                "sense_id": "7d5d7ed5-8890-383b-8d3b-cb24a38a0962",
                                                "text": "Khedron hesitated for a moment, wondering how far he should take Jeserac into his confidence. He knew that Jeserac was kindly and well-intentioned, but he also knew that he must be bound by the same taboos that controlled everyone on Diaspar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "669172c3-6af4-459e-90db-9fb65c35f788",
                                                "sense_id": "7d5d7ed5-8890-383b-8d3b-cb24a38a0962",
                                                "text": "But electric vehicles and the batteries that made them run became ensnared in corporate scandals, fraud, and monopolistic corruption that shook the confidence of the nation and inspired automotive upstarts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6af89e55-bf6e-3c86-b402-7747c6e4b71e",
                                        "entry_id": "4a72190e-4978-3219-8349-225208226a49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Information held in secret; a piece of information shared but to thence be kept in secret."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a9ca2b6-ec39-4f53-acab-368b3a1a7db1",
                                                "sense_id": "6af89e55-bf6e-3c86-b402-7747c6e4b71e",
                                                "text": "In the course of these confidences it became quite plain to me I had been represented to the wife of the high dignitary, and goodness knows to how many more people besides, as an exceptional and gifted creature - a piece of good fortune for the Company - a man you don’t get hold of every day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dae91c80-8457-32d2-ac69-01719c3315d1",
                                        "entry_id": "4a72190e-4978-3219-8349-225208226a49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Boldness; presumption."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
